# Work on branch ap-stat

All development work for this project should be done on the **ap-stat** branch.

- When making commits or pushing, use branch **ap-stat** (checkout ap-stat first if needed).
- Do not commit or push to other branches (e.g. frog-play, main) unless the user explicitly asks.
- If starting work and the repo is on another branch, switch to ap-stat before making changes: `git checkout ap-stat && git pull origin ap-stat`
